  Scenario: Help for an unknown topic is rejected with the help usage
    When the user runs "/claude:plugin help bogus"
    Then the result has these fields:
      | kind         | usage-error                              |
      | severity     | error                                    |
      | needs reload | false                                    |
      | message      | Unknown help topic: "bogus".             |
      | usage        | Usage: /claude:plugin help [marketplace] |

  Scenario: An unknown plugin subcommand shows the plugin usage with a reason
